  "content": "\n\n<a href=\"https://billing.sparkedhost.com/aff.php?aff=3266\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/6pLLiYf.png\"></a>\n<h2><strong>發光 TXF</strong></h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/emissive-txf\"><img src=\"https://cf.way2muchnoise.eu/full_428068_downloads.svg?badge_style=flat\" alt=\"CurseForge 下載次數\" /></a> <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/resourcepack/emissive-txf\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/dynamic/json?color=2d2d2d&amp;colorA=17b85a&amp;style=flat-square&amp;label=&amp;suffix=下載次數&amp;query=downloads&amp;url=https://api.modrinth.com/v2/project/izDZRaNR&amp;logo=modrinth&amp;logoColor=2d2d2d\" alt=\"Modrinth 下載次數\" /></a></p>\n\n<strong>以下項目提供發光紋理：</strong>\n\n- 礦石（鑽石、黃金、鐵、翡翠、石英、紅石、地獄金、銅）\n- 方塊（鍍金黑石、附魔桌、釀造台）\n- 物品（釀造台、火把、靈魂火把、紅石火把）\n- 更多...\n\n<strong>1.12.2 版本需要：</strong>\n\n- <a href=\"https://optifine.net/downloads\" target=\"_blank\">OptiFine 模組</a>\n- <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/resourcepack/vanilla-future-texture\" target=\"_blank\">Vanilla Future Texture (TXF)</a>\n\n<strong>1.16-1.20 版本需要：</strong>\n\n- <a href=\"https://optifine.net/downloads\" target=\"_blank\">OptiFine 模組</a> 或 <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/continuity\" target=\"_blank\">Continuity 模組</a>\n\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/izDZRaNR/images/9cbde4d660e54f7260b72ca62b23e0cc6102ac8b.png\">",
